<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Caution issued for S.Africa's Alliance, Forim.</title>
<headline>Caution issued for S.Africa's Alliance, Forim.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Alliance Pharmaceuticals Ltd on Monday asked shareholders to exercise caution when dealing with their shares in Alliance and Forim Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Alliance said in a statement it would acquire the business of GRS Medical (Pty) Ltd from July 1 and that negotiations were under way into additional transactions which, if successful, could affect the share price of both Alliance and Forim.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
